<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.5500 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.5500 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.5500 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.6500 on Monday.</p>
